+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Switch the worker playground configs from a small number limit to a callback that keeps svg files as urls, and check the worker asset url stays an emitted file (playground/worker/__tests__/es/es-worker.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+
+## 2. Config
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Widen the type of `build.assetsInlineLimit` to a number or a `(filePath, content) => boolean | undefined` callback, and move the default 4096 into a shared constant (packages/vite/src/node/build.ts, packages/vite/src/node/constants.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Document the callback form (docs/config/build-options.md)
+
+## 3. Inlining
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Move the inline decision of `fileToBuiltUrl` into one `shouldInline` helper: lib mode always inlines, a forced inline wins, then the callback's answer, then the limit with the html, svg-fragment and Git LFS exclusions (packages/vite/src/node/plugins/asset.ts)
